    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d355">

                <pb facs="0397" n="363" xml:id="pg363"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to Mr.
                            Draper.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-07-16"><hi rendition="#italic">July 16,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Italy and Greece only countries so far as known requiring consular visé. It is
                    the discrimination of Italy in requiring visé for meats from United States to
                    which this Government particularly objects.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Day</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
